## ⚠️ IMPORTANT: Replace these with your actual AWS URLs before building for production!
## For local development, use localhost values.
## For production (AWS), use your EC2 backend URL.

## LOCAL DEVELOPMENT:
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api

## PRODUCTION (uncomment and set your EC2 URL):
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
